From fe76ffb05f3b91c1f0e195051a7f0e90ec0ac138 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:33:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Host Events: unclaim, co-host names on poll,
 decide/start/cancel screen, Discord-name search on Points

- Co-hosts can unclaim from Discord; host (or owner) can force-unclaim on the site; poll and request message re-render with @co-host
- Claim limit now only counts still-open events (finished events no longer block claiming)
- Decide & Start screen: suggests exams from votes, warns on no votes/no co-host, Start posts the commencing message and removes poll + request, Cancel removes them
- Active events list on the Host Events page
- Points search matches Roblox display name, username, or Discord name (via Bloxlink); can_award_points holders allowed to use it
- v21
